 "description": "Select one candidate from a finished compose/consult ensemble as the project's saved composition (whole-candidate replace). Body REQUIRES both fields: { candidateIndex, selectStrategy: \"agent-authoritative\" } \u2014 candidateIndex from wait_job(kind=\"consult\") proposals (mode=amend) or the compose winner report; selectStrategy is required and API keys must use 'agent-authoritative' (editor-merge/editor-replace need an editor-session token and 403 on an API key). After selecting, render with create_render.",
